// A word cut by the norm cap is not a shorter catalog word.
// A whole word that fits stays. Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE clip ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG clip law

IMPULSE clip 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "clip" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
